	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D. in Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Reverende vir, en redeunt ad vos <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>stipendiati vestri cum testimonio, qud honeste vixerunt <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>apud nos, et nisi obstaret ista <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> irrequietudo, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quam puto causam esse revocationis eorum, gratum nobis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>fuisset, ut sua pręsentia diutius adornassent lectoria nostra.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Quid <placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName> fiat et qui rumores hic spargantur <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>de motibus bellicis regis <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> et principum confoederatorum, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>illi commodius referent, quam vacet scribere in praesentiarum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>D. <persName ref="p6096">Sledanus</persName>, reipublicae legatus, a <placeName ref="l1107">Tridento</placeName> domum rediit; <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>theologi autem nostri et <placeName ref="l572">Wirttembergenses</placeName> adhuc manent forte <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>usque ad kalendas maii.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Adversariis longe gratius fuisset, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>si prorsus nulli ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> docti viri advenissent; <foreign xml:lang="de">so <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hette das concilium schon ein loch gehapt,</foreign> et ipsi, si diis placet, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>victores anathemata sua prostituissent.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Petunt nostri, ut <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>omnes articuli ordine reasumantur, id quod et salvus conductus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>videtur polliceri, aut si hoc detrectent, ut confessio <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p458">Brentii</persName> exhibita ordine ad normam scripturę examinetur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Neutrum fortassis impetrabunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sunt simul in uno diversorio <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l572">Wirttenbergenses</placeName> et nostri; ex <placeName ref="l749">Saxonibus</placeName> nemo adest.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName>Philippus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>enim ultra <placeName ref="l361">Nornbergam</placeName> non venit et ad amicum quendam scripsit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>se non literas, sed et totos libros posse scribere de doloribus suis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Pridie vigilię paschę venit heroldus <placeName>Zaberniam</placeName> a rege <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>missus et petivit parari sibi commeatum pro exercitu adventante<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>; recensuit beneficia in episcopum collata a parente rege <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>cum enumeratione ingratitudinis episcopi et posse quidem gladio <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et igne ulcisci idque iure accepta incommoda; sed quando<note type="margin">a.R.: °qm =quoniam?</note> adveniet <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in salutem et libertatem <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName>, in praesentiarum se nolle.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hic <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>est status vicinię nostrę.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Omnipotens Iesus omnia vertat <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in gloriam nominis sui.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Bene vale et saluta <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>chorum optimorum ac doctissimorum hominum apud vos, cum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>primis <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quodsi posthac schola nostra aliqua in re iuventut<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>i vestrę possit gratum facere, offerimus operam nostram.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName> die progressionum, quę fuit altera pasche anno 52.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8374">Caspar Hedio</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Reverendo et doctissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> antistiti, meo maiori obs<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ervando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Bemerkung von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ultima d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><persName ref="p8374">Casparis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Hedionis</persName> <placeName ref="l491">Argen<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>toratensis</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Vom gleichen Datum in E II 356, 892 (Phot...) ein Brief von <persName ref="p8374">Hedio</persName> an Bürgermeister und Rat zu <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>. Empfehlung der heimkehrenden Zürcher Studenten.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
